      <blockquote><p>In the third line of the final text block of the proof (below the displayed equation <script type="math/tex">Z\to\mathrm{Proj}(\mathrm{Sym}(\Gamma(X,\mathcal{L})^*))</script>), "inverset" should be "inverse." </p></blockquote>
